# Official Hard zip

- Tracked checkpoint is only `models/quoridor_ppo_v1.zip`. Leave experiment zips, `backend/artifacts/`, and `models/finetune_*` untracked.
- Do not overwrite the official zip until Hard vs Easy **and** Hard vs Normal both reach ≥70% at 100 games, seed 97, max 400 plies, P99 ≤ 3000ms.
- 16-game runs are smoke only. Diagnose without `--min-win-rate`.
- After a zip replace, keep README Hard vs Easy / Hard vs Normal eval examples in sync.

